<title>USA: Westvaco Q4 Oct 31 shr declines.</title>
<headline>Westvaco Q4 Oct 31 shr declines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.55		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net		 55,596		   88,926</p>
<p> Sales	     778,723		  871,583</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  101,873		  101,528</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.09		    $2.78</p>
<p> Net		 212,156		  280,836</p>
<p> Sales	     3,045,450		3,272,447</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  101,737		  101,190</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Westvaco Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The fiscal 1995 net income includes $2.59 million or $0.02 per share extraordinary loss for the extinguishment of debt. The company said the decline in fiscal 1996 sales reflected challenging paper industry market conditions during the year.</p>
